{"page_id": "olmo_old_scans_math-4_pg433-p1", "markdown": "# DETERMINANTS\n\n417\n\n489. If each element of a column is multiplied by the same number, and the products be added to (or subtracted from) the corresponding elements of another column, the determinant is not altered.\n\nAccording to the preceding paragraph we have\n\nCz\n\nCa\n\nmbz\n\nmbz\n\nCz\n\nCz\n\naz I mbs\n\nBut the last determinant equals\n\nand hence vanishes (§ 485).\n\nca |\n\nEx. Evaluate\n\n4244 4245\n\n4246 4247\n\nThe determinant =\n\n4214 4245\n\n2\n\n2\n\n42441\n\n2\n\n=-2.\n\n490. Evaluation of determinants.\n\nBy means of the preceding\n\nproposition all elements but one in a column (or row) can be made equal to zero, and hence the determinant can be reduced to one of the next lower order ($ 480). In many cases, however, the determinant, before reduction to a lower order, should be simplified as follows:\n\n- Remove factors common to all elements in a row or a column.\n- Diminish the absolute values of the elements by subtracting the corresponding elements of other columns (or rows) or multiples of these elements. 2 E", "width": 902, "height": 1434, "blocks": [{"kind": "heading", "text": "DETERMINANTS", "bbox": {"x": 343.4768210427153, "y": 113.5249999834027, "width": 215.04635761589404, "height": 23.900000000000073}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "417", "bbox": {"x": 773.5695362844591, "y": 110.53749991037508, "width": 47.78807947019872, "height": 26.887499999999903}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "489. If each element of a column is multiplied by the same number, and the products be added to (or subtracted from) the corresponding elements of another column, the determinant is not altered.", "bbox": {"x": 71.21786664708458, "y": 167.80024007299326, "width": 753.5471443529951, "height": 128.69135127067568}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "According to the preceding paragraph we have", "bbox": {"x": 104.53642367862204, "y": 319.66249999213807, "width": 555.5364238410597, "height": 26.887500000000063}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Cz", "bbox": {"x": 337.503311071606, "y": 421.2374997385939, "width": 26.88079470198674, "height": 20.912499999999927}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Ca", "bbox": {"x": 340.4900660459603, "y": 460.0749997908749, "width": 23.89403973509936, "height": 20.912500000000087}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "mbz", "bbox": {"x": 582.4172184534436, "y": 415.2624997012499, "width": 50.77483443708605, "height": 29.875000000000053}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "mbz", "bbox": {"x": 588.3907283872186, "y": 454.09999973112497, "width": 44.801324503311285, "height": 26.887500000000063}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Cz", "bbox": {"x": 695.9139070756953, "y": 421.2374997609999, "width": 26.880794701986794, "height": 23.900000000000073}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Cz", "bbox": {"x": 698.900662027649, "y": 460.07499973859376, "width": 23.89403973509936, "height": 20.912499999999927}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "az I mbs", "bbox": {"x": 167.25827868331126, "y": 454.09999973112497, "width": 107.52317880794705, "height": 26.887500000000063}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "But the last determinant equals", "bbox": {"x": 101.54966871997792, "y": 528.78749998907, "width": 379.317880794702, "height": 26.887500000000063}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "and hence vanishes (§ 485).", "bbox": {"x": 364.3841058189561, "y": 624.3874999855443, "width": 328.54304635761594, "height": 26.887500000000063}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "ca |", "bbox": {"x": 319.5827812080574, "y": 666.2124997759375, "width": 41.81456953642385, "height": 26.887499999999903}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Ex. Evaluate", "bbox": {"x": 98.56291370237946, "y": 755.8374999687354, "width": 182.19205298013242, "height": 26.887500000000063}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "4244 4245", "bbox": {"x": 313.6092713705946, "y": 737.912499977269, "width": 146.35099337748343, "height": 20.912499999999927}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "4246 4247", "bbox": {"x": 308.8435140587244, "y": 760.3347584769751, "width": 169.12223136346074, "height": 